7:["$","p",null,{"children":"This construction distinguishes the scientific alternative from the calibration null. The alternative asks whether some block has positive pooled-whitened population contrast. Exact calibration requires the stronger statement that the complete data object is invariant under the allowed recording-level label transformations. Equality of two covariance matrices alone does not imply that exchangeability statement."}]
